# Gut tiles for top-down maps, 16x16: straw mat, paper-lattice wall faces,
# altar from above, candles, blade trestle, drum, gong, white cloth, a painting
# sized for the wall face. Flags, paper money and the soul boat: use the side
# view tiles (tiles_gut.pix) as standing objects.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_gut_td.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_gut_td_x4.png 4
@columns 8

